Hightlights you're The Events Calendar event with the help of Events Notification Bar Addon.

== Description ==
Highlights you're The Events Calendar event with the help of Events Notification Bar Addon. It represents your upcoming events information in a beautiful and elegant way using the countdown timer. It shows the Event notification bar on the top/bottom of the page and grabs users' (visitors) attention.

You can configure it with few clicks and also shows on specific pages. It also supports advance style settings.
Check Events Notification Bar Addon Demo:-<a href="https://eventscalendartemplates.com/events-notification-bar/">Click Here to view demo</a>

<h3>Here is the list of some Features:</h3>
<ul>
<li>Configure Venue, Countdown timer, Event date from event notification bar settings panel.</li>
<li>Set background color and font color for Event Notification Bar.</li>
<li>Advance setting to display a notification bar on all pages or on a specific page.</li>
<li>Fully responsive notification bar design.</li>
<li>Set custom date formats for event notification bar.</li>
<li>Configure position(Top or Bottom) of Event Notification Bar.</li>
<li>Set custom font size for event notification bar.</li>
<li>Set custom Content Area width for event notification bar.</li>
<li>Show Event Notification bar on page scroll and set custom scroll height</li>
<li>Show event countdown timer in the event notification bar.</li>
</ul>

It is a third party addon for The Events Calendar that extends the limitations of the event of The Events Calendar plugin, It is not developed or supported by The Events Calendar (by Modern Tribe)
== Installation ==
Install via WordPress Admin (best plugin installation method)
<ul>
<li>Login to WordPress Admin
In the left menu panel go to Plugins >> Add New plugin</li>
<li>Just search "Events Notifications Bar Addon"</li>
<li>Click on Install Now.</li>
<li>After that just activate the plugin </li>
<li>Please configure plugin from the settings panel.
</li>
</ul>
